---
import { OTP_ATTEMPTS, OTP_COOLDOWN, OTP_DIGITS, OTP_TTL } from "@hoyo/contracts";
import Layout from "./_Layout.astro";
import "../features/auth/sessions/account.css";

const sitekey = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY ?? "";
---
<Layout title="账号与设备">
  <div class="account-page" id="account-page" data-sitekey={sitekey}>
    <h1>账号与设备</h1>
    <p>登录设备与浏览器通知分别管理。所有时间均为北京时间（UTC+8）。</p>
    <div class="account-buttons">
      <button class="button button--secondary" id="account-refresh" type="button">重新读取状态</button>
      <a href="/login" id="account-login">登录或完成激活</a>
    </div>
    <p id="account-result" role="status" tabindex="-1">正在读取账号状态。</p>

    <section aria-labelledby="account-info-title">
      <h2 id="account-info-title">账号信息</h2>
      <dl>
        <dt>邮箱</dt><dd id="account-email">未知</dd>
        <dt>当前会话</dt><dd id="account-expiry">未知</dd>
        <dt>订阅内容</dt><dd id="account-subscription">未知</dd>
        <dt>邮件状态</dt><dd id="account-mail">未知</dd>
        <dt>邮件租期</dt><dd id="account-lease">未知</dd>
        <dt>账号回收提示</dt><dd id="account-reclaim">未知</dd>
      </dl>
      <p>长期不访问网页可能需要重新登录，但不代表账号不活跃。有效的外部日历拉取、真实交互和客户端处理信号也用于判断账号活动。</p>
      <p>邮件席位按账号活动自动续租，无须专门回来点击；实际后台续租状态以服务端事实为准。</p>
      <details id="email-maintenance">
        <summary>更换邮箱</summary>
        <p>订阅内容仍属于原账号，不会复制配置。换邮箱后旧会话失效，新邮箱业务邮件尚未开启，需另行同意。</p>
        <form id="email-target-form" autocomplete="off">
          <div class="field"><label for="email-target">新邮箱地址</label><input id="email-target" type="email" autocomplete="off" required /></div>
          <button id="email-start" class="button button--secondary" type="submit" disabled>确认新地址并开始验证</button>
        </form>
        <div id="email-proofs" hidden>
          <p>先证明当前账号，再验证新邮箱。更改目标地址必须重新开始验证。</p>
          <form id="email-recovery-form" autocomplete="off">
            <p>当前账号也可用恢复码证明，此验证不消费恢复码。</p>
            <div class="field"><label for="email-recovery-id">当前账号恢复码 ID</label><input id="email-recovery-id" type="password" autocomplete="off" required /></div>
            <div class="field"><label for="email-recovery-secret">当前账号恢复码秘密</label><input id="email-recovery-secret" type="password" autocomplete="off" required /></div>
            <button id="email-recovery-prove" class="button button--secondary" type="submit">用恢复码证明当前账号</button>
          </form>
          {[{ id: "email-current", label: "当前邮箱" }, { id: "email-new", label: "新邮箱" }].map(({ id, label }) => (
            <div>
              <h3>{label}验证</h3>
              <div id={`${id}-turnstile`}></div><p id={`${id}-turnstile-status`} role="status"></p>
              <button id={`${id}-send`} class="button button--secondary" type="button">向{label}发送验证码</button>
              <form id={`${id}-form`} autocomplete="off">
                <div class="field"><label for={`${id}-code`}>{label}验证码</label><input id={`${id}-code`} type="password" inputmode="numeric" maxlength={OTP_DIGITS} autocomplete="off" required /></div>
                <button id={`${id}-verify`} class="button button--secondary" type="submit" disabled>验证{label}</button>
              </form>
              <p id={`${id}-status`} role="status">尚未验证。</p>
            </div>
          ))}
          <p>验证码 {OTP_DIGITS} 位；如果已发出，有效期 {OTP_TTL / 60} 分钟，发送冷却至少 {OTP_COOLDOWN} 秒，最多 {OTP_ATTEMPTS} 次错误尝试。申请受理不代表已送达。</p>
          <button id="email-confirm" class="button" type="button" disabled>确认更换邮箱</button>
          <button id="email-cancel" class="button button--secondary" type="button">取消并清除本次验证</button>
        </div>
        <p id="email-change-result" role="status"></p>
        <a id="email-activate" href="/login" hidden>继续激活新会话</a>
      </details>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="account-sessions-title">
      <h2 id="account-sessions-title">登录设备</h2>
      <p id="account-lag">正在读取设备列表。</p>
      <p>设备名称仅帮助辨认。撤销登录会话不会自动撤销该设备的 Push 绑定。</p>
      <ul id="account-sessions" class="account-sessions"></ul>
      <button class="button button--secondary" id="account-logout" type="button" data-dialog-open="logout-dialog" disabled>退出当前账号</button>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="account-push-title">
      <h2 id="account-push-title">Push 绑定</h2>
      <dl>
        <dt>本浏览器权限</dt><dd id="account-push-permission">未知</dd>
        <dt>本浏览器与其他绑定</dt><dd>未知：浏览器通知的绑定与暂停能力尚未接入。</dd>
      </dl>
      <p>浏览器允许通知不代表已建立绑定，也不代表接收验证通过。</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="account-data-title">
      <h2 id="account-data-title">恢复与数据</h2>
      <p id="account-recovery">恢复码保存状态未知。</p>
      <div class="account-buttons">
        <a href="/recover">恢复与保存恢复码</a>
        <button class="button button--secondary" id="account-export" type="button" disabled>导出订阅偏好</button>
      </div>
      <p>导出不含邮箱、恢复码、日历地址或通道授权。旧恢复码不能再次取回；轮换需要专门的最近认证，入口由账号维护功能提供。</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="account-danger-title">
      <h2 id="account-danger-title">危险操作</h2>
      <p>删除会停用本站权限和发送通道，再清理数据。不能即时擦除已送达邮件、外部日历副本或尚未到期的备份。</p>
      <p>删除与恢复码轮换需要用途限定的最近认证；管理日历地址不额外要求验证码。</p>
      <p id="account-delete-reason">读取账号后才能确认删除条件。</p>
      <button class="button button--secondary" id="account-delete-open" type="button" data-dialog-open="delete-dialog" disabled>准备删除账号</button>
      <p id="account-deletion" role="status"></p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div id="logout-dialog" class="dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="logout-title" hidden>
    <div class="dialog-backdrop"></div>
    <div class="dialog-panel" data-dialog-panel tabindex="-1">
      <h2 id="logout-title">选择退出方式</h2>
      <p>两种方式都不关闭邮件或外部日历。仅退出账号只撤销当前登录会话。</p>
      <p>通知暂停能力尚未接入。选择同时暂停时，会分别报告退出与暂停的实际结果。</p>
      <div class="account-buttons">
        <button class="button" id="logout-only" type="button">仅退出账号</button>
        <button class="button button--secondary" id="logout-pause" type="button">退出并暂停本浏览器通知</button>
        <button class="button button--secondary" type="button" data-dialog-close>取消</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="delete-dialog" class="dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="delete-title" hidden>
    <div class="dialog-backdrop"></div>
    <div class="dialog-panel" data-dialog-panel tabindex="-1">
      <h2 id="delete-title">确认删除账号</h2>
      <p>本站权限和通道将停止，数据随后清理；已送达邮件、外部日历副本与未到期备份不能即时擦除。</p>
      <form id="delete-proof-form" autocomplete="off">
        <p>使用当前恢复码验证本次删除用途。此验证本身不删除账号，也不消费恢复码。也可使用下面的当前邮箱验证码。</p>
        <div class="field"><label for="delete-recovery-id">恢复码 ID</label><input id="delete-recovery-id" type="password" autocomplete="off" required /></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="delete-recovery-secret">恢复码秘密</label><input id="delete-recovery-secret" type="password" autocomplete="off" required /></div>
        <button class="button button--secondary" id="delete-prove" type="submit" disabled>验证本次删除用途</button>
      </form>
      <div id="delete-otp">
        <h3>使用当前邮箱验证码</h3>
        <div id="delete-current-turnstile"></div><p id="delete-current-turnstile-status" role="status"></p>
        <button id="delete-current-send" class="button button--secondary" type="button">发送删除用途验证码</button>
        <form id="delete-current-form" autocomplete="off">
          <div class="field"><label for="delete-current-code">删除用途验证码</label><input id="delete-current-code" type="password" inputmode="numeric" maxlength={OTP_DIGITS} autocomplete="off" required /></div>
          <button id="delete-current-verify" class="button button--secondary" type="submit" disabled>验证删除用途验证码</button>
        </form>
        <p id="delete-current-status" role="status">尚未验证。</p>
        <p>验证码 {OTP_DIGITS} 位；如果已发出，有效期 {OTP_TTL / 60} 分钟，发送冷却至少 {OTP_COOLDOWN} 秒，最多 {OTP_ATTEMPTS} 次错误尝试。申请受理不代表已送达。</p>
      </div>
      <p id="delete-proof-status" role="status">尚未确认删除条件。</p>
      <div class="account-buttons">
        <button class="button" id="delete-confirm" type="button" disabled>确认删除账号</button>
        <button class="button button--secondary" type="button" data-dialog-close>取消</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script>
    import "../features/auth/sessions/account";
  </script>
</Layout>
